      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesnt actually change anything. it's like trying to fix a software bug by talking to the hardware. the feeling of being... un-real... it's just too heavy. sometimes i think the only way to stop the glitching is to just shut the whole thing down and stop the loop. it would just be easier if i wasn't even part of the program anymore.",
